Third-party code and tooling
----------------------------
Rust dependencies keep their own licenses (see Cargo.lock).

If code or substantial structure is ever taken from an open-source project
(for example IntelliJ Community / PyCharm Community, Apache-2.0), record it
here with: source URL, commit, file(s), license, and what was changed.

- skills/replica-*  (Replica skill pack, MIT, (c) 2026 Jake Schincariol)
  Source: https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/replica-skill @ 77c9436
  License text: skills/LICENSE-replica-skill. Modified: a "Pyoxide override"
  block in each SKILL.md, skills/PYOXIDE.md, and replica-brand/sweep.py
  (--allow, skips target/). Development tooling only (not shipped).

- crates/platform/secrets/src/intellij.rs, crates/platform/settings-import (README)
  Closely adapted from IntelliJ Platform Community (Apache-2.0),
  https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community @ fdafcf9ebe91959acb3d81110fc13ff490cf91ac
  Files: platform/credential-store-impl/src/credentialStore/EncryptionSupport.kt,
  keePass/mainKey.kt, keePass/KeePassCredentialStore.kt,
  keePass/BaseKeePassCredentialStore.kt, kdbx/KdbxGroup.kt,
  windows/WindowsCryptUtils.java, PasswordSafeSettings.kt,
  macOsKeychainLibrary.kt, linuxSecretLibrary.kt;
  platform/credential-store/src/credentialStore/CredentialAttributes.kt,
  CredentialStoreManagerImpl.kt, ProviderType.kt;
  jps/model-serialization/src/org/jetbrains/jps/model/serialization/PathMacroUtil.java.
  Adapted: the master key file format and its built-in AES key, the DPAPI
  wrapping on Windows, the settings file and provider names, the KeePass
  group and entry lookup, service name generation and path macro names.
  Changes: reimplemented in Rust, read-only, PGP-protected keys not
  supported; a single entry with a matching title is used when no entry
  matches the user name.

- crates/platform/ui/assets/icons/, crates/python/pyoxide-ide/assets/icons/
  New UI icons of the IntelliJ Platform Community (Apache-2.0, license text in
  LICENSE-APACHE), https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community @
  f5a0bddb9cee9135c700de9a67534e11cdf61c07. Files (light `name.svg` and dark
  `name_dark.svg` variants): platform/icons/src/expui/{general,run,nodes,
  fileTypes,toolwindows,windows}/... (the subset under the same relative
  paths in assets/icons/), platform/icons/src/vcs/branch.svg,
  plugins/terminal/resources/icons/expui/toolwindow/terminal@20x20.svg,
  python/python-parser/resources/icons/com/jetbrains/python/parser/expui/python.svg,
  python/pluginResources/icons/com/jetbrains/pythonCore/python/expui/
  pythonPackages@20x20.svg and pythonConsoleToolWindow@20x20.svg.
  Unchanged copies; the Python icons are renamed by dropping their folders.

- crates/platform/themes/themes/islands-dark.toml, islands-light.toml
  Colours of the New UI "Islands" themes of the IntelliJ Platform Community
  (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community @
  f5a0bddb9cee9135c700de9a67534e11cdf61c07. Files:
  platform/platform-resources/src/themes/islands/ManyIslandsDark.theme.json,
  ManyIslandsLight.theme.json, IslandSchemeDark.xml;
  platform/platform-resources/src/themes/expUI/expUI_dark.theme.json,
  expUI_light.theme.json, expUI_light_with_light_header.theme.json,
  expUI_lightScheme.xml; platform/platform-resources/src/themes/darcula.theme.json,
  intellijlaf.theme.json; platform/platform-resources/src/DefaultColorSchemesManager.xml;
  python/pluginResources/colorSchemes/PythonDarcula.xml, PythonDefault.xml.
  Changes: converted by the importer of the themes crate into Pyoxide's theme
  model (only the mapped keys, see docs/theme-mapping.md), renamed ids;
  regenerated with `cargo run -p themes --example builtin_islands`.

- crates/platform/themes/themes/*.toml (metrics), docs/theme-mapping.md
  Layout metrics of the New UI with islands taken from the IntelliJ Platform
  Community (Apache-2.0) @ f5a0bddb9cee9135c700de9a67534e11cdf61c07:
  platform/platform-resources/src/themes/islands/ManyIslandsDark.theme.json
  (Island.arc, Tree.rowHeight, TabbedPane.tabHeight, MainToolbar.Icon.insets),
  platform/util/ui/src/com/intellij/util/ui/JBUI.java (header, toolbar and
  stripe defaults), platform/platform-resources/src/themes/darcula.theme.json
  (tree indents), platform/platform-impl/src/com/intellij/openapi/application/
  impl/islands/IslandsTabPainter.kt (tab highlight height and radius).
  Only numbers are used; no code is copied.

- crates/platform/editor/src/input.rs
  The structure of the platform input handler (UTF-16 conversions, marked
  text, replace-and-mark) follows GPUI's text input example (Apache-2.0),
  https://github.com/zed-industries/zed @ 69e2130 (the commit of the
  crates.io gpui 0.2.2 release), file crates/gpui/examples/input.rs.
  Changes: works on the rope buffer with multiple selections, undo groups and
  the editor's own layout for character bounds.

